(3092, 548, 'mission', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ALA aims to produce dynamic candidates with a global perspective an adaptive mode of functioning through integrated learning, practice and result oriented systematic approach. It focuses on character building and enhancing skill and competency to meet the needs of competitive world and live as a moral and dignified citizen. The School gives its students new thought, new ambition and new missions quality and result oriented education which would help to develop the children intellectually, mentally, morally, physically and socially at reasonable rate.</p>'),
(3093, 548, '_mission', 'field_626b960d8c909'),
(3094, 548, 'vision', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With a clear vision of developing ALA as an outstanding center of knowledge, art and skill and to create an education world in which children of all types and from all corner of the country have an opportunity for qualitative education in affordable fee structure. It prepares the students towards the higher goal of moral values with endowment of practical skills that will enable them to be perfect human beings. The school believes in imparting intensive and comprehensive learning for using progressive pedagogy.</p>'),
(3095, 548, '_vision', 'field_626b961b8c90a'),
(3096, 550, 'mission', ''),
