(8, 1, '2022-04-25 07:57:16', '2022-04-25 07:57:16', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ALA aims to produce dynamic candidates with a global perspective an adaptive mode of functioning through integrated learning, practice and result oriented systematic approach. It focuses on character building and enhancing skill and competency to meet the needs of competitive world and live as a moral and dignified citizen. The School gives its students new thought, new ambition and new missions quality and result oriented education which would help to develop the children intellectually, mentally, morally, physically and socially at reasonable rate.</p>', 'Mission Vision', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'mission-vision', '', '', '2022-05-04 12:46:16', '2022-05-04 07:01:16', '', 0, 'http://localhost/angellord/?page_id=8', 0, 'page', '', 0),
