(28, 1, '2022-04-26 05:29:03', '2022-04-26 05:29:03', 'Angel Lord Academy High School (ALAHS) established in 1997 in Koteshwor, Kathmandu is envisioned as a sacred learning home of knowledge, intellect, morals, discipline and good culture for the children. Since the inception of the school, it has been exerting its optimum efforts on imparting quality and value based education to the children who are believed to be the future of the nation. The school, institutionally, started its academic journey with about 150 students had only 4 students appearing SEE Board Examination in 2002 with excellent result. So far, the school has already had more than 600 students attempting the Iron-Gate with 100% successful result.', 'Welcome to Angel Lord', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'welcome-angel', '', '', '2022-04-26 06:29:01', '2022-04-26 06:29:01', '', 0, 'http://localhost/angellord/?page_id=28', 0, 'page', '', 0),
