(288, 1, '2022-05-02 12:39:25', '2022-05-02 06:54:25', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ALA strives to provide a dynamic academic program of instruction leading the students in enabling to realize their potential for excellence. The curriculum designed and program conducted by the school make the students help mental, physical, social, moral and psychological development in optimum level possible.\r\nProgressive pedagogy adopted by ALA helps teachers and students work together in a constructive, engaging learning environment which ensures better learning atmosphere for students in school. Evaluation system, including formative and summative modes, practiced by ALA helps maintaining wide range of evaluation of individual students paving the better ways to plan upon diverse level and nature of students.</p>', 'Academic Program', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'academic-program', '', '', '2022-05-04 15:35:50', '2022-05-04 09:50:50', '', 0, 'http://localhost/angellord/?page_id=288', 0, 'page', '', 0),
