(538, 1, '2022-05-04 12:06:10', '2022-05-04 06:21:10', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">ALA adopts the curriculum designed by Curriculum Development Centre(CDC) under Ministry of Education, Science and Technology, Nepal. Additionally, supplementary education materials are also prescribed for students to expand the horizon of their knowledge and enhance the skill, creativity and competency accommodate in the competitive world.</p>', 'Curriculum', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'curriculum', '', '', '2022-05-04 13:32:25', '2022-05-04 07:47:25', '', 0, 'http://localhost/angellord/?page_id=538', 0, 'page', '', 0),
